window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Escape with three captivating, full-length and feel-good love stories, along with never-before-published bonus epilogues for each audiobook!</p> <p>In <i>Only You</i>, you’ll be swept away by Nate and Emme’s hot and hilarious, friends-to-lovers romance. She’s a wedding planner looking for her own happily ever after. He’s the divorce lawyer - and single dad - across the hall who says there’s no such thing.</p> <p>Can she change his mind?</p> <p>In <i>Only Him</i>, Maren is reunited with sexy tattoo artist Dallas, her first love, who’s determined to make up for breaking her heart. Will she give him a second chance?</p> <p>In <i>Only Love</i>, you’ll meet a gorgeous former Marine with a tortured soul, the beautiful, compassionate therapist living next door, and the hilariously meddlesome grandma determined to get them together.<br> </p>"; 
